Arara Code: render extension-provided sections in the empty editor.

The extension owns labels, recent-project presentation, standard folders and
access-mode behavior. Core only renders sections and invokes their commands.
Refreshes when configuration or recent workspaces change.

Why a patch: the native editor watermark has no extension API for custom content.
Touches: src/vs/workbench/browser/parts/editor/editorGroupWatermark.ts,
         src/vs/workbench/browser/parts/editor/media/editorgroupview.css

